<div class="reading"><p class="eyebrow">Design review notes</p><h1>A prototype, not a launch decision.</h1><p>This design follows PRS v0.9. Role switching, sample OTP, fictional evidence and time controls exist only to help reviewers explore the experience. They must never appear in a production build (FR036).</p><div class="panel"><span class="badge warn">DEC01 · Open</span><h3 data-design-style="s1">Loan launch</h3><p>Gifts and loans remain in scope. Loans need privacy, evidence and dispute readiness before launch.</p></div><div class="panel"><span class="badge warn">DEC02 · Open</span><h3 data-design-style="s2">Equipment configurations</h3><p>Rollator classification and approved wheelchair configurations need a decision.</p></div><div class="panel"><span class="badge warn">DEC03 · Open</span><h3 data-design-style="s3">Privacy and recovery</h3><p>Evidence retention, consent duration, caregiver authority, deletion and recovery proof remain open.</p></div><div class="panel"><span class="badge warn">DEC04 · Open</span><h3 data-design-style="s4">Support capacity</h3><p>Named coverage, actual support hours and feasible response targets need approval.</p></div><div class="panel"><span class="badge warn">DEC05 · Open</span><h3 data-design-style="s5">Messaging exceptions</h3><p>Conversational SMS treatment, other nonresponse timers and opt-out recovery need approval.</p></div><div class="panel"><span class="badge warn">DEC06 · Open</span><h3 data-design-style="s6">Freshness and loan timing</h3><p>Renewal interval, month-to-day conversion, loan start and extension reminders remain open.</p></div><h2>Scope of this prototype</h2><p>Interactive: browsing, combined filters, gift/loan requests, donor offers, reservations, cancellation, owner reopening, listing review, recall holds, cases, sample evidence revocation and routine SMS preference.</p><p>Not implemented in this design preview: secure authorization, real OTP, SMS delivery, uploads, document extraction, live recall screening, location services, production storage, retention/deletion, rate limits, accessible recovery and staff operations. No real personal data should be entered.</p></div>